{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10281180","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10281180","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1028118001:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌ、どうして答えないのですか！？","source_cn":"伊温，你为什么不回答我？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x228C472D8FAB9E22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028118002:0":{"text":"フラベルさん……？","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x125174165CD7D3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028118003:0":{"text":"答えなくても分かります。君は「恋人たちの祈り」を出る勇気がない。そうでしょう？この臆病者！","source_cn":"不用你回答我也知道，你没有胆量踏出情人之愿，对不对？因...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFC7C6A84EB120BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028118004:0":{"text":"君が臆病だから、何もかも失うのです。エルゴンや「恋人たちの祈り」の景色、そしてターラン村のすべての命を――","source_cn":"就是因为懦弱，你才会一直失去，伊尔贡，情人之愿的风景，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8971E8E329A49034","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028118005:0":{"text":"フラベルさん……ど、どうしたんですか？具合が悪いのですか？","source_cn":"芙拉贝尔……你、你怎么了？你不舒服吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BD3EFCC2133880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028118006:0":{"text":"君は弱すぎる。いつか君はそのせいですべてを失い、取り返しがつかなくなるのです！","source_cn":"你太弱小了，总有一天你会因此失去一切，无法挽回！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x992B2614C43DF4B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028118007:1":{"text":"ち、ちが……フラベルさ……","source_cn":"不、不是的……芙拉贝尔……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FA8865C2683B7BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028118008:0":{"text":"マスター、イヴォンヌさんの記憶……どこか変ですよ？フラベルさんはこんなに酷いことを言う方ではないはずです！","source_cn":"主人，伊温小姐的回忆……是不是哪里出错了？芙拉贝尔明明...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2ABB9C081AD48CB0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、イヴォンヌさんの記憶……どこか変ですよ？フラベルさんはこんなに酷いことを言う方ではないはずです！","female":"マスター、イヴォンヌさんの記憶……どこか変ですよ？フラベルさんはこんなに酷いことを言う方ではないはずです！","variant_male_record_index":"110817","variant_female_record_index":"110818","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028118009:0":{"text":"これは本当の記憶なのでしょうか？","source_cn":"那是真实的记忆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x952E50E231EEBEA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1028118009":{"text":"これは本当の記憶なのでしょうか？","source_cn":"那是真实的记忆吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x952E50E231EEBEA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028118010:0":{"text":"この記憶……フラベルさんはこんなこと言ってません……絶対に！","source_cn":"那段回忆……芙拉贝尔没有那么说过……绝对没有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4E09E3BFCBD00B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028118011:0":{"text":"これは、歪められた……偽の記憶です！","source_cn":"那是假的……是被扭曲了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6B5E8D9BB50134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028118014:2":{"text":"グオオオオオオ！！！","source_cn":"噢噢噢噢噢——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x111E7525E4276456","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028118015:0":{"text":"イヴォンヌさん、汚染に影響されてはいけません！しっかりしてください！でないと、記憶が壊れてしまいます！","source_cn":"伊温小姐，不要被污染影响了，控制好它，不然你的记忆碎片...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF8EBE8DDF9E4392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028118016:0":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ！これ以上邪魔されないよう、魔物はロンロンたちが抑えます！","source_cn":"别担心，我们来挡住魔物，绝对不会让它们再影响到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBE054688CA7FF83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"